# Dyuti OS — Plasma color scheme (light variant).
# Direction: crisp neutral grey-white, restrained saffron accent. Generated from
# design-tokens.md (light theme). Surfaces rise toward white; depth is carried by
# shadow, so elevated surfaces stay light. Saffron (255,157,77) appears only as
# DecorationFocus/Hover and selection.

